    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Verified cycles",
      "items": [
        "One SCC of six: metrics, cache, hybridLruCache, memoryPressureManager, gitService, repositoryCoordinator",
        "Three direct two-cycles: metrics<->cache, metrics<->memoryPressureManager, metrics<->repositoryCoordinator",
        "metrics imports memoryPressureManager dynamically, which avoids a static cycle"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Consequences",
      "items": [
        "gitService imports the cache service: the lowest layer reaches upward",
        "No module in the knot can be unit-tested without the other five",
        "Import order is implicit, which is a likely cause of the flaky suite"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Fan-in",
      "items": [
        "logger 22, metrics 17, config 11, cache 7",
        "metrics is imported by routes, services and utils alike",
        "Leaves: logger, config, hashUtils, urlSecurity, serializationWorker, requestId, strictContentType, routes/index"
      ]
    }
